{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987270/extras/12b983780b5e97bbc758c5f38ee0d321.avif?t=1757533644\" width=1560 height=152 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A cursed time loop. Two aliens. A deck full of decisions.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Fantasy</strong> - a planet full of danger, secrets\u2026 and a suspicious number of golden statues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master skills, play smarter with every loop and build your perfect automation setup. But beware: the world resets and the curse never sleeps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987270/extras/b03cec9827033950d14e998ce9e9361d.poster.avif?t=1757533644\" width=1170 height=293 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987270/extras/b03cec9827033950d14e998ce9e9361d.webm?t=1757533644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Card Choices</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick between two story-driven cards at almost every step. Each one represents an event, encounter or opportunity that shapes your journey and reveals more of the fantasy world\u2019s secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skill-Based Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every card is linked to a skill. Chop wood to improve Woodcutting. Run to boost Agility. The more you do something, the better your character gets at it. Trained skills help you progress faster in future runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987270/extras/113723c32eb987f6e18db34af79dac18.poster.avif?t=1757533644\" width=1170 height=293 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987270/extras/113723c32eb987f6e18db34af79dac18.webm?t=1757533644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Curse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious curse drains your life over time. Only speed, planning and well-trained skills give you a chance to push forward. Efficiency is survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pro tip: glowing ancient statues rarely grant blessings.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Time Loop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you die, the world resets. The loop is part of the story, part of the puzzle and part of the gameplay. Escaping it might just be the Secret of Fantasy itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987270/extras/dd8d133904b15b29656a3343653d3793.avif?t=1757533644\" data-has-big width=1560 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987270/extras/2bff169eeabe13421e285b176fff6b7a.avif?t=1757533644\" width=1560 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Card and Talent Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards level up the more you use them. As they grow, they unlock valuable talent points you can invest to shape your build and unlock new strategies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987270/extras/49c0fd3e0b7ca28acdc70fbec9fb73a8.poster.avif?t=1757533644\" width=1170 height=293 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987270/extras/49c0fd3e0b7ca28acdc70fbec9fb73a8.webm?t=1757533644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Perks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and choose perks that support your strategy. They provide helpful bonuses that improve stats, reduce costs or boost certain actions during your run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987270/extras/bb44bea8537df6e398b5253efbe06c2a.poster.avif?t=1757533644\" width=1170 height=293 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987270/extras/bb44bea8537df6e398b5253efbe06c2a.webm?t=1757533644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987270/extras/dd8d133904b15b29656a3343653d3793.avif?t=1757533644\" data-has-big width=1560 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987270/extras/519330d1b6f3286f93add3eff6949eb9.avif?t=1757533644\" width=1560 height=152 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Automation and Idle Systems</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock automation features gradually. Set priorities, toggle automatic actions and let your strategy play out on its own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Auto Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is fully automated and turn-based. Improve your fighting skills and watch as your aliens face rats and other enemies with increasing confidence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987270/extras/6b7048b1a44cb6e1ad52a3c0ff5a6477.poster.avif?t=1757533644\" width=1170 height=293 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987270/extras/6b7048b1a44cb6e1ad52a3c0ff5a6477.webm?t=1757533644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987270/extras/dd8d133904b15b29656a3343653d3793.avif?t=1757533644\" data-has-big width=1560 height=87 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987270/extras/0dde6d63886220cab3c3abfbdde8dfbc.avif?t=1757533644\" width=1200 height=499 /></span><strong>Humor and Pop Culture Fun</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quiqueck and H\u00e4mat are full of one-liners, jokes and sci-fi nonsense. Their dialogue is packed with pop culture references and alien sarcasm that keeps the tone light and fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987270/extras/dd8d133904b15b29656a3343653d3793.avif?t=1757533644\" data-has-big width=1560 height=87 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What\u2019s included in this demo</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo covers the <strong>first Book</strong> of Secret of Fantasy, introducing Quiqueck &amp; H\u00e4mat as well as the curse and the time loop at the heart of the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect about <strong>4-6 hours</strong> to see most of the demo\u2019s content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll play early exploration cards that introduce <strong>skill leveling</strong>; each action improves its associated skill over time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first <strong>automation tools</strong>\u2014auto-actions and priority settings\u2014unlock so your plan can start running on its own between decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early <strong>talent tiers</strong> and a small, focused set of <strong>perks</strong> shape your build; combat plays out fully automatically against rats and other early foes such as the Dragon-Wiener.  </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3987270?t=1757533644","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3987270?t=1757533644","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987270/7fad3db6aca9ca010b8f3c65e28e6b48bed3e59e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757533644","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987270/7fad3db6aca9ca010b8f3c65e28e6b48bed3e59e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757533644","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987270/extras/12b983780b5e97bbc758c5f38ee0d321.avif?t=1757533644\" width=1560 height=152 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A cursed time loop. Two aliens. A deck full of decisions.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Fantasy</strong> - a planet full of danger, secrets\u2026 and a suspicious number of golden statues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master skills, play smarter with every loop and build your perfect automation setup. But beware: the world resets and the curse never sleeps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987270/extras/b03cec9827033950d14e998ce9e9361d.poster.avif?t=1757533644\" width=1170 height=293 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987270/extras/b03cec9827033950d14e998ce9e9361d.webm?t=1757533644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Card Choices</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick between two story-driven cards at almost every step. Each one represents an event, encounter or opportunity that shapes your journey and reveals more of the fantasy world\u2019s secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skill-Based Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every card is linked to a skill. Chop wood to improve Woodcutting. Run to boost Agility. The more you do something, the better your character gets at it. Trained skills help you progress faster in future runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987270/extras/113723c32eb987f6e18db34af79dac18.poster.avif?t=1757533644\" width=1170 height=293 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987270/extras/113723c32eb987f6e18db34af79dac18.webm?t=1757533644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Curse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious curse drains your life over time. Only speed, planning and well-trained skills give you a chance to push forward. Efficiency is survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pro tip: glowing ancient statues rarely grant blessings.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Time Loop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you die, the world resets. The loop is part of the story, part of the puzzle and part of the gameplay. Escaping it might just be the Secret of Fantasy itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987270/extras/dd8d133904b15b29656a3343653d3793.avif?t=1757533644\" data-has-big width=1560 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987270/extras/2bff169eeabe13421e285b176fff6b7a.avif?t=1757533644\" width=1560 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Card and Talent Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards level up the more you use them. As they grow, they unlock valuable talent points you can invest to shape your build and unlock new strategies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987270/extras/49c0fd3e0b7ca28acdc70fbec9fb73a8.poster.avif?t=1757533644\" width=1170 height=293 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987270/extras/49c0fd3e0b7ca28acdc70fbec9fb73a8.webm?t=1757533644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Perks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and choose perks that support your strategy. They provide helpful bonuses that improve stats, reduce costs or boost certain actions during your run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987270/extras/bb44bea8537df6e398b5253efbe06c2a.poster.avif?t=1757533644\" width=1170 height=293 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987270/extras/bb44bea8537df6e398b5253efbe06c2a.webm?t=1757533644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987270/extras/dd8d133904b15b29656a3343653d3793.avif?t=1757533644\" data-has-big width=1560 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987270/extras/519330d1b6f3286f93add3eff6949eb9.avif?t=1757533644\" width=1560 height=152 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Automation and Idle Systems</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock automation features gradually. Set priorities, toggle automatic actions and let your strategy play out on its own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Auto Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is fully automated and turn-based. Improve your fighting skills and watch as your aliens face rats and other enemies with increasing confidence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987270/extras/6b7048b1a44cb6e1ad52a3c0ff5a6477.poster.avif?t=1757533644\" width=1170 height=293 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987270/extras/6b704